WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.875
[This talk contains graphic language
and descriptions of sexual abuse]

00:00:16.792 --> 00:00:21.583
Can I get a show of hands
who here has ever Googled themselves?

00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:25.083
I have.

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:31.351
But what started off
as momentary curiosity

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:34.309
very quickly turned

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:38.976
into an almost five-year horrific battle

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.958
that almost ruined my life.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.333
I Google Images reverse-searched myself:

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:50.351
a function of Google
that allows you to upload an image

00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:53.518
and it shows you
where it is on the internet.

00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:57.851
This is me at 17 years old.

00:00:57.875 --> 00:01:01.309
An innocent selfie I took before a party.

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:03.976
Now, before I continue, I must point out

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.750
that what I'm about to talk about
is very confronting and graphic.

00:01:09.708 --> 00:01:10.976
But there's no way out.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.917
This is a very confronting issue.

00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:17.934
In a split second,

00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:22.726
my screen was flooded with that image

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.726
and dozens more images of me

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:28.851
that had been stolen from my social media,

00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:32.000
on links connected to porn sites.

00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:39.559
On these sites, nameless,
faceless sexual predators

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:44.268
had published highly explicit
sexual commentary about me

00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:46.042
and what they'd like to do to me.

00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:50.643
"Cover her face and we'd fuck her body,"

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:52.000
one person wrote.

00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:57.393
They also published
identifying information about me:

00:01:57.417 --> 00:02:01.167
where I lived, what I studied, who I was.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.833
But things got worse.

00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:08.768
I soon discovered
that these sexual predators

00:02:08.792 --> 00:02:13.976
had doctored or photoshopped my face

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:19.333
onto the bodies of naked adult actresses
engaged in sexual intercourse,

00:02:20.208 --> 00:02:21.833
on solo shots

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:26.083
of me being ejaculated on by two men.

00:02:27.042 --> 00:02:30.000
Sperm was edited onto my face.

00:02:31.792 --> 00:02:35.333
I was edited onto the cover of a porn DVD.

00:02:37.042 --> 00:02:39.976
Perpetrators had edited my images

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:44.893
to give the effect that my blouse
was transparent or see-through,

00:02:44.917 --> 00:02:46.792
so you could see my nipples.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:52.559
Perpetrators ejaculated on images of me,

00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:59.559
took photos of their sperm
and penises on these images

00:02:59.583 --> 00:03:01.708
and posted them onto porn sites.

00:03:02.792 --> 00:03:05.750
"Cum on printed pigs,"
is what they call it.

00:03:07.375 --> 00:03:09.684
Now, you might be wondering,

00:03:09.708 --> 00:03:12.708
what sorts of images
I posted on social media.

00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:18.059
This is me, at around 19
at the Claremont Hotel,

00:03:18.083 --> 00:03:19.667
just a few suburbs away.

00:03:20.875 --> 00:03:25.375
And they superimposed that face into this.

00:03:26.958 --> 00:03:28.893
And things got worse.

00:03:28.917 --> 00:03:31.726
Nothing was off limits
for these predators.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:36.417
They even posted an image
with my little sister on these sites too.

00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:39.101
Now, you might be thinking,

00:03:39.125 --> 00:03:42.226
"Well, you do dress provocatively,

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:45.768
even a little sexually suggestive,

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:47.458
attention seeking maybe."

00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:52.184
But just because
a woman's body gets attention,

00:03:52.208 --> 00:03:54.208
doesn't mean she's attention-seeking.

00:03:55.375 --> 00:03:59.184
And what is provocative anyway,
what is sexually suggestive?

00:03:59.208 --> 00:04:02.893
In some parts of the world,
showing your ankles

00:04:02.917 --> 00:04:05.458
is promiscuous, is provocative.

00:04:06.917 --> 00:04:10.518
It's just like, no matter
what a woman wears,

00:04:10.542 --> 00:04:14.083
it's always perceived
as more sexual than it is.

00:04:15.125 --> 00:04:18.500
For me, I just wanted
to feel pretty and confident.

00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:21.583
What's so wrong with that?

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.684
Now, you might be thinking,

00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:29.541
"Well, can't you just
set your social media on private?"

00:04:31.625 --> 00:04:34.851
Well, these perpetrators were calculated.

00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:37.851
They befriended my friends on social media

00:04:37.875 --> 00:04:40.476
under fake profiles,

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.059
they followed the public galleries

00:04:43.083 --> 00:04:47.000
of the events and places
I regularly visited.

00:04:49.417 --> 00:04:50.976
But why?

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:54.643
Why should one have to retreat and hide

00:04:54.667 --> 00:04:57.958
out of fear that something
like this could happen?

00:04:59.583 --> 00:05:02.351
What I post and what I wear

00:05:02.375 --> 00:05:06.101
isn't an invitation
to violate and abuse me.

00:05:06.125 --> 00:05:10.184
The only person that should be
changing their behavior

00:05:10.208 --> 00:05:11.542
is the perpetrators.

00:05:12.375 --> 00:05:19.375
(Applause)

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.167
Now, you might be thinking, why me?

00:05:27.042 --> 00:05:30.476
Well, I'm just one

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:33.351
of the thousands upon thousands

00:05:33.375 --> 00:05:36.458
of ordinary women
who are being preyed upon

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:44.684
in these mass-scale, horrific
online cultures, websites and threads

00:05:44.708 --> 00:05:50.226
that are dedicated
to sexually exploiting and doctoring

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.958
ordinary images of women into porn.

00:05:54.083 --> 00:05:55.667
As I speak,

00:05:56.958 --> 00:06:00.583
there are women who are being preyed upon,
and they don't even know it.

00:06:02.708 --> 00:06:06.559
In the beginning, I tried seeking help.

00:06:06.583 --> 00:06:10.309
I went to police,
I contacted government agencies,

00:06:10.333 --> 00:06:14.184
I even tried to hire
a private investigator,

00:06:14.208 --> 00:06:15.833
but they were too expensive.

00:06:17.167 --> 00:06:19.434
There was nothing that they could do.

00:06:19.458 --> 00:06:21.184
I mean, what could you do

00:06:21.208 --> 00:06:26.583
when the sites are hosted overseas
and the perpetrators are from overseas?

00:06:28.875 --> 00:06:33.393
I was told I had to contact
the sites one by one,

00:06:33.417 --> 00:06:37.167
notifying the webmasters
to get everything deleted.

00:06:38.708 --> 00:06:41.101
And so as you can imagine,

00:06:41.125 --> 00:06:45.333
in complete and utter fear and pain,

00:06:46.833 --> 00:06:48.083
I did.

00:06:48.875 --> 00:06:50.917
I contacted the webmasters,

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:56.458
requesting that they delete
the material shared without consent.

00:06:57.167 --> 00:07:00.018
And I had some successes,

00:07:00.042 --> 00:07:02.375
but I also had some major setbacks.

00:07:04.292 --> 00:07:06.167
The more I fought,

00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:09.643
the more sites I would discover,

00:07:09.667 --> 00:07:13.934
and with time, the more my images
were being seen and shared

00:07:13.958 --> 00:07:16.518
in the tens of thousands.

00:07:16.542 --> 00:07:22.958
I had one webmaster respond to me
saying he'll only delete the site

00:07:23.833 --> 00:07:27.917
if I sent him nude photos
of myself within 24 hours.

00:07:29.083 --> 00:07:30.684
And this went on for years,

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:34.934
fighting against these
dodgy, disgusting sites.

00:07:34.958 --> 00:07:37.833
But I was fighting a losing battle.

00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:42.833
And I couldn't continue this any longer
for my own mental health.

00:07:44.375 --> 00:07:46.042
But what could I do?

00:07:47.875 --> 00:07:51.958
Maybe, I thought, if I spoke out,

00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:55.726
I could reclaim my name,

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:59.309
and I could rewrite my narrative
on my own terms.

00:07:59.333 --> 00:08:01.434
Maybe if I spoke out,

00:08:01.458 --> 00:08:03.792
I could raise awareness about this.

00:08:04.625 --> 00:08:08.208
Maybe I could even try to change the law.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.750
And so I did.

00:08:12.208 --> 00:08:19.167
(Applause)

00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:24.476
I spoke out publicly late last year

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.708
and news of my story
reverberated around the world.

00:08:29.542 --> 00:08:31.893
But this was the response.

00:08:31.917 --> 00:08:35.309
"She's a fat, ugly slut, she's a whore."

00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:38.393
"She's an attention-seeking
piece of trash."

00:08:38.417 --> 00:08:41.393
"Feel flattered, baby, it's a compliment."

00:08:41.417 --> 00:08:44.601
I was victim-blamed and slut-shamed

00:08:44.625 --> 00:08:47.500
and told I was deserving
of what happened to me.

00:08:48.625 --> 00:08:50.518
And quite frankly,

00:08:50.542 --> 00:08:53.393
that was more difficult for me to endure

00:08:53.417 --> 00:08:57.458
than my actual experiences
of image-based abuse.

00:08:59.208 --> 00:09:02.101
But I couldn’t let
this criticism defeat me.

00:09:02.125 --> 00:09:05.184
I knew what the perpetrators
had done was wrong,

00:09:05.208 --> 00:09:08.351
and I knew what they were doing
to others was wrong.

00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:09.958
And so I petitioned.

00:09:10.917 --> 00:09:15.059
I sent out impassioned pleas for support.

00:09:15.083 --> 00:09:16.851
But it didn't work.

00:09:16.875 --> 00:09:19.708
I think I got like 330 signatures.

00:09:20.542 --> 00:09:22.250
And that was really disheartening.

00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:28.292
But I then contacted
my state and federal MPs.

00:09:29.542 --> 00:09:33.976
And I was referred to the New South Wales
Attorney General's department,

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:38.268
who were already in the process
of drafting new laws

00:09:38.292 --> 00:09:43.125
to criminalize the nonconsensual
distribution of intimate images.

00:09:44.792 --> 00:09:46.458
Image-based sexual abuse.

00:09:47.667 --> 00:09:50.458
Some of you might know it as revenge porn.

00:09:52.417 --> 00:09:54.934
And soon I became a spokesperson,

00:09:54.958 --> 00:09:57.292
a public face for the new laws.

00:09:58.375 --> 00:09:59.643
But I must point out,

00:09:59.667 --> 00:10:01.726
I do not in any way, shape or form

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:04.643
want to take credit
for this change in the law.

00:10:04.667 --> 00:10:07.309
This is on the backs
of cybersafety experts,

00:10:07.333 --> 00:10:10.976
of researchers, of the Attorney
General's department,

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.708
of so many people
who have fought for years.

00:10:15.042 --> 00:10:19.917
New South Wales was the first
state in all the world

00:10:21.625 --> 00:10:25.351
to specifically include a provision
on altering images.

00:10:25.375 --> 00:10:26.851
Something that happened to me,

00:10:26.875 --> 00:10:29.893
something you certainly
don't hear about very often.

00:10:29.917 --> 00:10:34.059
And now ACT has also criminalized this,

00:10:34.083 --> 00:10:36.726
also with a provision on altered images.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:40.393
And next year, WA
is introducing legislation

00:10:40.417 --> 00:10:44.684
and hopefully, they introduce
a provision on altered images

00:10:44.708 --> 00:10:48.434
and I urge every state and every country
in this world to follow suit,

00:10:48.458 --> 00:10:49.726
because right now,

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.667
there's no justice for people like me.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.476
Despite it all,

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.417
despite the hate
and despite the criticism,

00:10:59.917 --> 00:11:02.643
despite the fact that I'm never
going to get justice,

00:11:02.667 --> 00:11:06.417
because my experiences happened
before this movement of law reform,

00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:10.601
