the best thing I've ever done,

00:11:10.625 --> 00:11:13.292
because I know for a fact
that it has helped people.

00:11:17.292 --> 00:11:19.083
And I just want to live in a world

00:11:20.917 --> 00:11:23.768
where, regardless
of what I wear or what I post,

00:11:23.792 --> 00:11:28.833
that I'm still worthy of being treated
with dignity and respect.

00:11:31.125 --> 00:11:32.375
Respect.

00:11:33.167 --> 00:11:35.500
Now, that's an idea worth sharing.

00:11:36.042 --> 00:11:37.226
(Applause)

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.518
Thank you.

00:11:38.542 --> 00:11:44.667
(Applause)

